        "question": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "A teacher records the following test scores (out of 100) for her class of 20 students:\n\nScores: 45, 52, 71, 67, 61, 74, 76, 78, 79, 82, 83, 85, 86, 87, 88, 89, 91, 92, 94, 98\n\n(5 points) Calculate the 25th percentile (first quartile Q1)."
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "先排序: 45,52,61,67,71,74,76,78,79,82,83,85,86,87,88,89,91,92,94,98\n算法待确认: 若按位置(n+1)p, h=5.25, Q1=71+0.25(74-71)=71.75; 若按下半组中位数/整数np取相邻平均, Q1=(71+74)/2=72.5; R默认type=7用h=1+(n-1)p=5.75, Q1=73.25; nearest-rank为第5个数71\n原题未指定百分位算法, 应使用课程讲义规定, 不将其中任一值冒充唯一答案"
          }
        ],
