        "question": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "A sample of 5 individuals with the following weights (in kg):\n\nWeights: 45, 52, 61, 67, 75\n\n(7 points) Calculate the sample standard deviation."
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "x̄=(45+52+61+67+75)/5=60 kg\nΣ(xi-x̄)²=225+64+1+49+225=564 kg²\n样本方差s²=564/(5-1)=141 kg², 样本标准差s=√141≈11.8743 kg"
          }
        ],
        "sources": [
